{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-389",
  "title": "Competition",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Competition"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Good instinct to check—but no, there's **nothing with this exact combination** of properties. Let me map what exists:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Close neighbors (but missing key pieces)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**SPARQL + SHACL stack**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: RDF queries, shape validation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: Embedded computation in-document, units, deterministic time, incremental views, provenance as first-class"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: SPARQL is external queries *over* data, not computation *within* it. No portable DAG."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**JSON Schema + JSON Logic**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: Validation, simple expressions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: Graph semantics, queries across documents, RDF interop, units, provenance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: JSON Logic is too anemic (no proper stdlib, no aggregation), JSON Schema can't express derived properties"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Datalog variants (Datomic, LogicBlox, Souffle)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: Rules, incremental views, queries, temporal (in Datomic)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: JSON-LD compatibility, units, deterministic serialization, web linking"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: Closed-world databases, not web-scale linked data. Can't embed computation in exchanged documents."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**GraphQL**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: Queries, schema, resolvers"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: Computation travels with data, RDF semantics, units, rules, constraints, provenance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: Resolvers are code-behind, not portable specs. No determinism guarantees."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Excel/Google Sheets**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: Formulas, reactive computation, incremental recalc"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: RDF/linked data, structured queries, provenance, signatures, type safety"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: Great UX, terrible for programmatic interchange or auditing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Nix/Dhall/CUE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: Pure functional configuration, type checking, determinism"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: RDF/graph semantics, queries, units, temporal validity"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: Config languages, not data interchange. No web linking or provenance chain."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**XTDB (formerly Crux)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: Temporal database, datalog, immutability, transaction log"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: Portable document format, units, embedded computation that travels with data"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: Database engine, not a document specification."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Hydra/JSON-LD APIs**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Has: RDF, hypermedia, linked data"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Missing: Computation, validation, queries in-document"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Problem: Describes *APIs*, not computable data."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The gap LD-C fills"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The unique combination is:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **JSON-LD compatible** (web linking, RDF interop)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Computation travels with data** (portable DAG, not code-behind)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Deterministic** (time/randomness injected, not sampled)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Units as values** (dimensional analysis)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Incremental** (views, invalidation tracking)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Auditable** (provenance + signatures first-class)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. **Constraint-checked** (not just validated, but with computed predicates)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Closest spiritual ancestor: **Turtle + SPARQL + SHACL + custom application code**, but that's a *stack*, not a single portable format. LD-C collapses it into one exchangeable document."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why the gap exists"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Most systems optimize for one of:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Data exchange** (JSON-LD, RDF): computation is external"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Computation** (Datalog, Nix): data exchange is secondary"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Databases** (Datomic, XTDB): can't serialize computation portably"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Config** (CUE, Dhall): not designed for linked, evolving data"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "LD-C sits in the **Venn diagram center**: linked data that carries its own computation rules, deterministically evaluatable anywhere, with audit trails."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Prior art that came close"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Tim Berners-Lee's N3/Notation3** (2000s) had rules and formulas in RDF, but:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Never standardized"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No units, no deterministic time handling"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Baroque syntax"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No modern tooling"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**RIF (Rule Interchange Format)** W3C spec:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Way too complex (died from over-generalization)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No JSON, no modern ergonomics"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Didn't integrate with JSON-LD"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Wolfram Language** notebooks:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Computation + data together"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "But: proprietary, not RDF, not web-scale"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The validator test"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ask: \"Can I send a financial report as LD-C and have the recipient reproduce all computed totals, verify signatures, check constraints, and trace provenance *from the document alone*?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No existing format says yes to all of that. You need:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Database + code + validation rules + separate audit trail + manual unit tracking"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "LD-C: \"It's in the JSON.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**My guess why it doesn't exist**: it requires touching three communities (semantic web, data engineering, PL/formal methods) that don't usually talk. You need:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-86",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "RDF people to accept computation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Data engineers to accept linked data"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "PL researchers to accept \"good enough\" determinism over full formal verification"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The design threading that needle—pragmatic but principled—is *hard*. You've done it. I genuinely think this is novel enough to matter."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}